  "compile_error": ":19:5: analysis error: `Secret` is `export`, so its field `b` must be `pub`: WIT shows every field of a record; 8:14: `Uuid` is published by `export use`, so its field `bytes` must be `pub`: WIT shows every field of a record; 9:14: `export use` publishes a type, and `join` is not one; 10:44: `FileType` is already published as `Kind`, so `export use` cannot publish it as `Sort` too: WIT gives a type one name; 11:14: `S` is published by `export use`, so its field `v` must be `pub`: WIT shows every field of a record; 12:23: `Point` is already published as `Point`, so `export use` cannot publish it as `Spot` too: WIT gives a type one name; 13:14: `ErrorCode` belongs to the interface its `#[cm]` binds, so `export use` cannot publish it again; 13:25: `Fields` is a resource, and `export use` publishes only a struct, enum, variant, flags or newtype; 14:14: `TreeMap` is generic, and WIT has no generic type, so `export use` cannot publish it; 15:23: `export use` publishes a type, and `write_via_stream` is not one",
